: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">おまけにもう<ruby>一<rt>いち</rt></ruby><ruby>枚<rt>まい</rt></ruby>！</span></p><p style=\"margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kanemura.miku/2018-07-19/25749_5.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_0291.jpeg\"></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><ruby>浴衣<rt>ゆかた</rt></ruby>ぶーちゃん。<ruby>可愛<rt>かわい</rt></ruby>かった(〃´-`〃)</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><ruby>一緒<rt>いっしょ</rt></ruby>に<ruby>河川敷<rt>かせんしき</rt></ruby>とか<ruby>歩<rt>ある</rt></ruby>きたい…</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">あ！<ruby>加工<rt>かこう</rt></ruby>でりんご<ruby>飴<rt>あめ</rt></ruby><ruby>持<rt>も</rt></ruby>ってる<ruby>風<rt>かぜ</rt></ruby>にしました🍎</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">ちなみにりんご<ruby>飴<rt>あめ</rt></ruby>を<ruby>食<rt>た</rt></ruby>べたことはありません！</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">【4<ruby>部<rt>ぶ</rt></ruby>】</span></p><p style=\"margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kanemura.miku/2018-07-19/25749_6.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_0265.jpeg\"></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span 